  "description": "Reid Comfort 2 700c ST | Step-through commuter bike\nComfortable, practical and designed for everyday journeys – the Reid Bikes Comfort 2 700c ST is a versatile step-through commuter bike for navigating urban streets, cycling to work and exploring light trails.\nBuilt around a lightweight 6061 alloy frame with internal cable routing, the Comfort 2 features a step-through design for easier mounting and dismounting. Its relaxed geometry encourages a more upright riding position, while the adjustable stem allows you to fine-tune your fit for added comfort.\nThe 80mm Uding D6 suspension fork helps absorb bumps and vibrations from uneven surfaces and includes a lockout function for more efficient riding on smoother roads. The 700c double-wall alloy wheels and 700x38mm tyres provide a balance of stability, grip and rolling efficiency across different routes.\nA Shimano Acera 8-speed drivetrain offers a practical range of gears for everyday cycling and tackling varied inclines. Shimano 8-speed shifters provide straightforward gear changes, while mechanical disc brakes with 160mm rotors deliver reliable stopping power and control in different conditions.\nFinished with 620mm alloy riser handlebars, ergonomic grips and a comfortable saddle, the Reid Bikes Comfort 2 700c ST is designed to make commuting and recreational cycling more enjoyable.\nThe Reid Bikes Comfort 2 700c ST is ideal for:\n\nEasy mounting and dismounting, with a step-through frame design\n\nEveryday commuting, with relaxed geometry and an upright riding position\n\nUrban cycling and leisure rides, with 700c wheels for efficient rolling\n\nVaried routes, with Shimano Acera 8-speed gearing and an 11-40T cassette\n\nSmoother riding, with an 80mm suspension fork featuring a lockout function\n\nReliable braking, with mechanical disc brakes and 160mm rotors\n\nComfort and adjustability, with ergonomic grips, riser handlebars and an adjustable stem",
